你的問題其實是 OFAC_GLSpec 的資料到底是從哪邊來的。

看起來有兩種可能：

1. OFAC_GLSpec.ent_num = DJ_Entity.EntityId
2. OFAC_GLSpec.ent_num = DJ_List_Data_A.EntNum

所以你可以先確認 ent_num 對的是誰。

第一步，先看 OFAC_GLSpec 有哪些資料

SELECT TOP 100 *
FROM BSADB.dbo.OFAC_GLSpec

假設看到：

ent_num
--------
12345
67890
11111

先去找是不是 DJ_Entity

SELECT *
FROM BSADB.dbo.DJ_Entity
WHERE EntityId = 12345

如果找得到，再看看是不是 Sanctions List

SELECT *
FROM BSADB.dbo.DJ_ListCategory
WHERE EntityId = 12345

例如：

EntityId    Description2
---------   -----------------
12345       Sanctions Lists

代表有符合。

第二種，直接把條件全部 JOIN 起來

SELECT
    A.ent_num,
    B.Description2,
    B.Description3,
    C.PersonStatus,
    D.IdentificationType,
    D.IdentificationNumber
FROM BSADB.dbo.OFAC_GLSpec A
JOIN BSADB.dbo.DJ_ListCategory B
    ON A.ent_num = B.EntityId
JOIN BSADB.dbo.DJ_Entity C
    ON A.ent_num = C.EntityId
LEFT JOIN BSADB.dbo.DJ_IdentificationTypeInfo D
    ON A.ent_num = D.EntityId
WHERE B.Deleted = 0

如果你只想看你的 SP 會抓到的資料，可以直接把條件全部加進去。

SELECT
    A.ent_num,
    B.Description2,
    B.Description3,
    C.PersonStatus,
    D.IdentificationType,
    D.IdentificationNumber
FROM BSADB.dbo.OFAC_GLSpec A
JOIN BSADB.dbo.DJ_Entity C
    ON A.ent_num = C.EntityId
JOIN BSADB.dbo.DJ_ListCategory B
    ON A.ent_num = B.EntityId
LEFT JOIN BSADB.dbo.DJ_IdentificationTypeInfo D
    ON A.ent_num = D.EntityId
WHERE C.PersonStatus <> 'Inactive'
AND (
        B.Description2 = 'Sanctions Lists'
     OR B.Description3 IN (
            'OFAC Related - Majority Owned',
            'OFAC Related - Control',
            'OFAC - Regional Sanctions Related - Majority Owned',
            'OFAC - Regional Sanctions Related - Control',
            'EU Related - Majority Owned',
            'EU Related - Control',
            'EU - Regional Sanctions Related - Majority Owned',
            'EU - Regional Sanctions Related - Control'
        )
    )
AND B.Deleted = 0
AND D.IdentificationType IN (
        'Aircraft Construction, Line, Fleet or Serial Number',
        'Aircraft Manufacturer''s Serial Number (MSN)',
        'Bank Identifier Code (BIC)',
        'Central Registration Depository (CRD)',
        'Company Identification No.',
        'Driving Licence No.',
        'DUNS Number',
        'International Maritime Organization (IMO) Ship No.',
        'International Securities Identification Number (ISIN)',
        'Legal Entity Identifier (LEI)',
        'National ID',
        'National Provider Identifier (NPI)',
        'National Tax No.',
        'Others',
        'Passport No.',
        'Social Security No.',
        'Email',
        'Fax',
        'Phone'
    )
AND D.Deleted = 0;

如果是想知道「為什麼 OFAC_GLSpec 沒被抓到」

最好用 LEFT JOIN 一層一層看是哪個條件被擋掉。

SELECT
    A.ent_num,
    C.PersonStatus,
    B.Description2,
    B.Description3,
    B.Deleted AS ListDeleted,
    D.IdentificationType,
    D.Deleted AS IDDeleted
FROM BSADB.dbo.OFAC_GLSpec A
LEFT JOIN BSADB.dbo.DJ_Entity C
    ON A.ent_num = C.EntityId
LEFT JOIN BSADB.dbo.DJ_ListCategory B
    ON A.ent_num = B.EntityId
LEFT JOIN BSADB.dbo.DJ_IdentificationTypeInfo D
    ON A.ent_num = D.EntityId
WHERE A.ent_num = XXXXX;

例如會看到：

ent_num   PersonStatus   Description2        IdentificationType
-------   ------------   ----------------   --------------------
12345     Active         Sanctions Lists     Passport No.

或是

12345     Active         NULL                Passport No.

代表被 DJ_ListCategory 擋掉。

12345     Inactive       Sanctions Lists     Passport No.

代表被

PersonStatus <> 'Inactive'

擋掉。

12345     Active         Sanctions Lists     Company No.

代表被

IdentificationType IN (...)

擋掉。

⸻

如果你的目的是做 Root Cause Analysis，我會建議最後一個寫法最好用。拿 OFAC_GLSpec.ent_num 去做 LEFT JOIN，所有條件先不要下，只把資料攤開來看，很容易就知道它到底是被哪一個條件 (PersonStatus、Description2/3、Deleted、IdentificationType) 擋掉的。